.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Two qubits, each individually prepared in the unbiased state \lvert+\rangle = (\lvert0\rangle+\lvert1\rangle)/\sqrt2 -- an unentangled product state -- are coupled by an Ising interaction \hat H = \hbar J\,\sigma_z^{(1)}\otimes\sigma_z^{(2)} and become genuinely entangled purely through that interaction&#x27;s time evolution, reaching a maximally entangled (Bell-equivalent) state at Jt=\pi/4. Unlike the static Bell/EPR correlations of /api/gallery/quantum/entanglement/plot_entanglement_and_topology (which start from an already-entangled state), this traces entanglement&#x27;s actual dynamical genesis.">

